摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Hand your long DSH session over to a clean one: /handoff summarizes the conversation with an LLM, creates a new session+agent in the same workspace, injects the handoff document, and auto-opens it.","id":"gh:1335979237","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-handoff","slug":"WeiYe6/dsh-session-handoff","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Hand your long DSH session over to a clean one: /handoff summarizes the conversation with an LLM, cr"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"eates a new session+agent in the same workspace, injects the handoff document, and auto-opens it."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-handoff"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Hand your long DSH session over to a clean one.** `/handoff` summarizes the recent\nconversation wi"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"th an LLM, creates a **brand-new session + agent** in the same workspace\n(no history copied), inject"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"s a structured handoff document as its first message, and\n**auto-opens** it — the model continues fr"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"om the summary instead of replaying the whole\nold history. The origin session is untouched."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **One command** — `/handoff [<N>|all]` (defaults to the last 8 user messages; `all`\ncovers everyth"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ing)\n- **Clean handoff** — a fresh session with the origin's workspace, model route, and\nagent prese"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"t (system prompt / tools / skills), no context bloat\n- **Structured summary** — 任务目标 / 当前进度 / 关键决策 /"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" 涉及文件 / 下一步 / 遗留问题\n- **Auto-open** — the client half waits for the new session to be ready and navig"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ates\nto it (each child auto-opens once; history replay never re-jumps)\n- **Robust by default** — sum"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"maries run with thinking off (fast, cheap), oversized\nexcerpts keep the newest messages instead of e"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"rroring, and finish reasons\n(`max-tokens` / `error` / `aborted`) are translated into actionable erro"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"rs\n- **Zero core changes** — a single `dsh.bundle.patch` row; only public services are used"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> Dev-time source link (`dsh plugin --profile web add D:/path/to/dsh-session-handoff`) requires\n> th"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"e source dir's `node_modules` to resolve `@deepseek-ai/*` peers; prefer the tarball."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Type in any conversation's input box:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"What happens:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. A command card shows \"summarizing…\";\n2. An LLM produces the handoff document (goal / progress / d"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ecisions / files / next\nsteps / open questions), which becomes the new session's first message;\n3. T"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"he new session **auto-opens**; the origin session stays intact and is linked back."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Privacy**: the recent conversation text (user + assistant messages in the\n> requested window)"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" is sent to the configured model to produce the summary."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Without `provider`/`model`, the current session's latest logged model route\n(`session.requestHeader("},{"id":"p18s2","text":"vider`/`model`, the current session's latest logged model route\n(`session.requestHeader()`) is used."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Host half** (`index.mjs`, plain ESM): public services only — `commands`\n(`/handoff`), `llm` (`ct"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"x.llm.stream`, following official `session-title-llm`),\n`agents` (`ctx.agents.create` — session **an"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"d** agent together, inheriting the\norigin's cwd / model route / agent preset via `agentPresets.mount"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"`), plus\n`workspaceRegistry.attachSession` (same-workspace grouping) and\n`sessionTitle.rename` (a `h"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"andoff: <source>` title).\n- **Client half** (`src/client/`, tsdown → `lib/client.js`): a `handoff`\nc"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"onversation node matches the `/handoff` success event and auto-opens the child\nsession (polling unti"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"l it is addressable, deduped via localStorage)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Publish checklist: add the `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic → open a PR to\nawesome-deepseek-harness →\noptio"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"nally `npm publish`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- The handoff document lives in the session only; it is not written to disk\n(`HANDOFF.md` is a futur"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e enhancement).\n- Supports the DSH `0.1.0-rc.5` through `rc.8` line and `0.1.1-rc.2`.\nDSH `0.1.2-alp"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ha.1` is intentionally excluded because its conversation UI/service\nsplit requires a separate client"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"-side migration.\n- The auto-open path has jsdom component coverage, but real browser timing still\nne"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"eds end-to-end verification."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
